      {
        "y_pos": 9,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 18,
        "widget": {
          "title": "This Dashboard provides the following details:",
          "text": {
            "content": "**Inventory:**\n1. List of **1P** Volumes** of the customer \n2. List of **3P** Volumes of the customer\n3. List of **Hardware** Volumes of the customer\n4. List of **Flex** Volumes of the customer \n5. List of **Regions** where the customer has volumes\n6. Number of **API** requests over a period of time\n\n**Errors:**\n7. List of volumes which are **not in available** state\n8. List of volumes which **failed to create**\n9. Number of **API** requests that **failed** over a period of time\n\n**Note: If the filter does not match, the charts/tables will show all the customer data.**\n\n*This is the default behiviour of varibles in Google Dashboards*",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
              "font_size": 4,
              "pointer_location": 0
            }
          },
          "id": ""
        },
        "x_pos": 0
      },
      {
        "x_pos": 24,
        "y_pos": 9,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 18,
        "widget": {
          "title": "How to use this Dashboard",
          "text": {
            "content": "\nUse the customer id filter on top of the Dashboard to select one or multiple project IDs related to a specific customer. \n\nThe below charts will show the details related to the project id if it matches one in the list.\nIf there is no match, the chart will show details of all the project IDs\n\nYou can also filter directly in the chart by clicking on the three lines next to the value in the table. \nEntire dashboard will be filtered based on the selected Value",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
              "font_size": 4,
              "pointer_location": 0
            }
          },
          "id": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 48,
        "height": 9,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Purpose of the dashboard",
          "text": {
            "content": "1.Whenever you recieve a customer ticket and get the project number from the ticket and use this dashboard to filter volumes for those project number and check the health of the volumes\n\n2.Whenever you get an alert to identify the customer impact, get the customer list and project numbers from incident managers and identify how many volumes are impacted\n\nFrom both and #1 and #2 you can debug further. ",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
              "font_size": 4,
              "pointer_location": 0
            }
          },
          "id": ""
        },
        "x_pos": 0,
        "y_pos": 0
      },
      {
        "y_pos": 111,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 20,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Customer API Requests Failed",
          "xy_chart": {
            "data_sets": [
              {
                "time_series_query": {
                  "time_series_filter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/customerReq\" resource.type=\"internal_http_lb_rule\" metric.label.\"httpStatus\"=monitoring.regex.full_match(\"5.*\") ${customer_id}",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignment_period": "60s",
                      "per_series_aligner": 1,
                      "cross_series_reducer": 4,
                      "group_by_fields": [
                        "metric.label.\"httpStatus\""
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "unit_override": "",
                  "output_full_duration": false
                },
                "plot_type": 3,
                "min_alignment_period": "60s",
                "target_axis": 1,
                "legend_template": ""
              }
            ],
            "y_axis": {
              "scale": 1,
              "label": ""
            },
            "chart_options": {
              "mode": 1
            },
            "thresholds": []
          },
          "id": ""
        },
